      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS VINCENZA (4) was successful at her most recent outing by a head in a far better performance at this track over 1780m. Meets a similar line up so she can add to the strong recent effort. EYE BETTER (2) disappointed backers last time out when seventh, beaten 20 metres, over 2242m at Narrogin. Form prior to that was far better, including a sound second over 2190m at this track two starts ago. Has the benefit of a good draw. Her recent effort is not a true indication. Good enough to put herself right in the finish. ICY COLD (9) is the next elect off a last-start win by 4.5 metres at Pinjarra over 1177m. SHECANPLAY (3) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 1780m at this track.",
